Dear {!Case.Contact.Name},

We are writing to inform you that you have been named as a successor for the Donor-Advised Fund account held by {!Case.Account.Name}. We extend our sincere condolences during this difficult time.

YOUR OPTIONS:
You have three pathway options available to you:

1. FINAL GRANT TO CHARITY
   Direct the account balance as charitable grants to organizations of your choice

2. TRANSFER TO NEW DAF ACCOUNT
   Become the new account holder and continue charitable giving

3. DISCLAIM SUCCESSOR RIGHTS
   Decline your rights, and the account will be handled per organizational policy

COMPLETE YOUR PATHWAY SELECTION:
Please use the secure online form below to make your pathway selection and provide required information:

👉 COMPLETE PATHWAY FORM: [Form URL will be added here]

The form will take approximately 10-15 minutes to complete and will be pre-filled with account information.

PHONE FOLLOW-UP:
Our Estate Administration team will call you within the next 3-5 business days to:
• Formally notify you of your successor designation
• Answer any questions about the three pathways
• Provide guidance on the process

Please note: Pathway selection must be completed through the online form. Our team cannot accept pathway instructions over the phone.

SUPPORT:
